    {
      "source": "Returns a new <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> that will apply the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> to the current one.",
      "translation": "返回一个新的 <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的接口\"><code>Streamable</code></a>，该新对象将把给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"java.util.function 中的类或接口\"><code>Function</code></a> 应用于当前对象。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "Convenience method to allow adding a <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> directly as otherwise the invocation is ambiguous between\n<a href=\"#and(java.lang.Iterable)\"><code>and(Iterable)</code></a> and <a href=\"#and(java.util.function.Supplier)\"><code>and(Supplier)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "提供便捷方法，允许直接添加一个 <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的接口\"><code>Streamable</code></a>，否则在 <a href=\"#and(java.lang.Iterable)\"><code>and(Iterable)</code></a> 和 <a href=\"#and(java.util.function.Supplier)\"><code>and(Supplier)</code></a> 之间调用会产生歧义。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "A collector to easily produce a <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a> using <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Collectors.html#toList()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Collectors.toList()</code></a> as\nintermediate collector.",
      "translation": "一个收集器，能够利用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Collectors.html#toList()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Collectors.toList()</code></a> 作为中间收集器，轻松从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a> 生成一个 <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> from the current one and the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> concatenated.",
      "translation": "从当前对象和给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> 创建一个由它们拼接而成的新 <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> from the current one and the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a> concatenated.",
      "translation": "从当前对象和给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a> 创建一个新 <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的接口\"><code>Streamable</code></a>，并将它们连接起来。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a new <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> that will apply the given filter <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a> to the current one.",
      "translation": "返回一个新的 <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的接口\"><code>Streamable</code></a>，该对象将把给定的过滤 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"java.util.function 中的类或接口\"><code>Predicate</code></a> 应用于当前对象。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>的<a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的接口\"><code>Streamable</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a non-parallel <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a> of the underlying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个底层<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>Iterable</code></a>的非并行<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"java.util.stream 中的类或接口\"><code>Stream</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "A collector to easily produce a <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a> and the given intermediate collector.",
      "translation": "一个收集器，用于从给定的中间收集器和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a> 中轻松生成一个 <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> from the current one and the given values concatenated.",
      "translation": "从当前对象和给定的值拼接创建一个新的<a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的接口\"><code>Streamable</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns an empty <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个空的<a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的接口\"><code>Streamable</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the current <a href=\"Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> is empty.",
